  "conclusions": [
    "For these five v76 misses, no correctly overlapping plant-winning anchor reaches the fixed0.35 confidence before NMS; raising max_det from8 to300 does not recover a valid operating detection.",
    "Several correctly overlapping anchors exist at lower plant confidence; this is not evidence of a missing image, coordinate conversion failure or absent raw geometry.",
    "The foliage hanging pot has raw matching score official0.773/v69 0.758/v76 0.098; the frozen full-frame v76 report regression is reproduced at raw-score level.",
    "Some basket anchors favor CutArrangement; official COCO basket scores were already below0.35, so fine-tuning alone is not established as the unique cause of every miss."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Only three repeatedly observed development VAL images; no fresh TEST or PICO evidence.",
